# Copy to `.env.local` to override. Vite exposes only VITE_-prefixed values.

# Where uploaded artwork is stored.
#
#   unset            → /api/assets, which the dev server proxies to the local
#                      asset Worker (`npm run assets:dev`) using a real bucket
#   ""               → no asset host; images are embedded in the entry instead
#   absolute URL     → that host, e.g. https://needle-assets.<you>.workers.dev
#
# A production build must set this, or leave it empty to opt out of uploads:
# the dev proxy path does not exist in a deployed site.
# VITE_ASSET_ENDPOINT=https://needle-assets.example.workers.dev
